{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-003.md","record_count":27,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹா...ஹா...! சபாஷ் கீதா! சபாஷ்! புழுவைப் போல் நெளிந்து புள்ளி மயிலைப்போல் ஆடிவிட்டாய்... அய்யோ அய்யோ... அய்யோ... எக்கச்சக்கமான அபிநயம், ஏராளமான முகவெட்டு, அசைவு கிசைவு, வலைவு கெளிவு எல்லாம் அபாரம்! அபாரம்!!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"தாயம்மாள்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பப்பா! என்ன திருஷ்டி, ஹும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரொம்ப களைப்பாயிருக்கும், ஏய் யாரங்கே!... காபி சாப்பிடுகிறியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊஹும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கூல்ட்ரிங்...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊக்கும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தக் காலத்துப் பெண்கள் நாலு குதி குதிச்சாலும், மேமூச்சு, கீழ்மூச்சு வாங்குது. எங்க காலத்திலே நாங்க ஆட ஆரம்பிச்சோம்னா, ஒண்ணுகால் முறியணும்; இல்லாட்டி மேடை முறியணும்! ஹி...ஹி... அப்படி ஆடுவோம் தம்பி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன், இப்பத்தான் என்ன. நீங்க ஆடாமலே மேடை கிடை யெல்லாம் தூள் தூளாப் பறக்குமே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்... அது கிடக்க பழைய கதை, என்னமோ தம்பி, என் பொண்ணு உக்களையே நம்பியிருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இருக்கட்டும்; இருக்கட்டும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அவளை ஆளாக்க வேண்டியது உங்க பொறுப்பு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"வேலைக்காரி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(அங்கு வந்து) உங்களைப் பார்க்கணுமாம், யாரோ ஒரு பொம்பளை வந்திருக்காங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! பொம்பளையா? யாரது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம் வணக்கங்க! என் பெயர் ராணி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரு? என்ன வேணும்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒங்க நாடகத்துக்கு டிக்கட் விற்பனை செய்ய ஒரு பெண் தேவை யென்று கேள்விப்பட்டேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம், ஆமாம். தேவைதான்; தேவைதான். இப்படி உட்காரேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம், பரவாயில்லையிங்க, அந்த வேலையை எனக்குக் கொடுத்தால்——","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம், பாடத் தெரியுமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என் பொண்ணுக்கு ஆடவும் தெரியுமே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடாடா - இது வேற சிவ பூசையிலே கரடி மாதிரி பூந்துகிட்டு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா, நீ சும்மா இரும்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பரவாயில்லை ராணி! நாளைக்கு நாடகம் நடக்கம் போவது—பிறகு தொடர்ந்து நாடகங்களை நடத்திக்கிட்டே இருக்கப் போகிறோம்! நாங்களெல்லாம் 'அமைச்சூர்ஸ்'—அதிகமா சம்பளம் எதிர்பார்க்கக்கூடாது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சம்பளத்தைப் பத்தி என்னங்க,","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம், நீ நாளைக்கு டிக்கட்டு விற்கிற திறமையைப் பாத்துகிட்டு அப்புறம் சம்பளம் போட்டுத் தர்ரோம்,","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரொம்ப நன்றிங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s003-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s003","scene_ordinal":3,"transition_audit_id":"T003","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹே ஹே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-003.md"}]}